# Uleguerand - Dominion Op #07 (abyssea 107, op 580): a level 99 Warrior in Abyssea - Uleguerand; the op's target
# Svelldrake (17 placed spawns, the first 17813715). The next op (#08, Adasaurus) and Altepa's and Grauberg's #07
# accepted (a GM), this op available: a Svelldrake killed: no section: nothing. This op accepted (a GM;
# activeDominionOp stays 0, which dominionOnMobDeath does not read): a Svelldrake killed: dominionOnMobDeath(580):
# Quest[8][107]Prog 1 (FOV_DEFEATED_TARGET 1 of 5). The next op's Adasaurus killed: Quest[8][108]Prog 1 (its own count),
# this op's unchanged. Prog 4 (a GM): one more: Prog 5 (5 of 5); another: the count is full (numDefeated < 5 is false):
# nothing. Completed (Prog 0, as completeDominionOp leaves it; a GM): another killed: no section: nothing. Abyssea -
# Uleguerand's IDs.lua names no mob, so each kill names its mob by id (kill #<id>). Perfect Dodge, Invincible and
# Elemental Sforzo (GM effects) keep the chars alive through the kills (the Abyssea mobs aggro and link).
lists AbysseaUleguerand/Svelldrake/onMobDeath AbysseaUleguerand/Adasaurus/onMobDeath
char zone=AbysseaUleguerand pos=-240,-40,-520 job=WAR lvl=99
login
effect 49                               # a GM: Perfect Dodge (melee hits evaded)
effect 50                               # a GM: Invincible (no physical damage)
effect 522                              # a GM: Elemental Sforzo (no magic damage)
quest Abyssea.DominionOp08Uleguerand accepted # a GM: the next op
quest Abyssea.DominionOp07Altepa accepted # a GM: Altepa's #07
quest Abyssea.DominionOp07Grauberg accepted # a GM: Grauberg's #07
kill #17813715                          # available: nothing
quest Abyssea.DominionOp07Uleguerand accepted # a GM
kill #17813716                          # accepted: Prog 1
kill #17813692                          # Adasaurus: Quest[8][108]Prog 1
charvar Quest[8][107]Prog 4             # a GM
kill #17813717                          # Prog 5
kill #17813718                          # full: nothing
quest Abyssea.DominionOp07Uleguerand completed # a GM
charvar Quest[8][107]Prog 0             # a GM
kill #17813719                          # completed: nothing
